    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点5：希尔伯特变换",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            146,
            85,
            386,
            105
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "一个实值函数 $x(t)$ 的希尔伯特变换是 $x(t)$ 和 $1 / \\pi t$ 的卷积。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            117,
            642,
            135
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "假设 $x(t)$ 是一个实值函数，求该函数的希尔伯特变换。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            145,
            621,
            162
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\hat {x} (t) = H [ x (t)) ] = x (t) * \\frac {1}{\\pi t} = \\frac {1}{\\pi} \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} \\frac {x (\\tau)}{t - \\tau} d \\tau\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            299,
            171,
            695,
            209
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "因此 $\\hat{x}(t)$ 可以被解读为 $x(t)$ 的线性时不变系统的输出，该线性时不变系统的脉冲响应为：",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            217,
            848,
            263
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nh (t) = \\frac {1}{\\pi t}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            450,
            271,
            546,
            307
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "该脉冲响应的傅里叶变换为:",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            313,
            403,
            331
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nH (\\omega) = - j s g n (\\omega) = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} - j, & \\omega > 0 \\\\ j, & \\omega \\leq 0 \\end{array} \\right.\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            344,
            340,
            652,
            374
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点 6: 希尔伯特变换—90°移相器",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            144,
            405,
            529,
            425
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "信号经过希尔伯特变换之后，频域内各频率成分的幅值不变，但相位出现 $90^{\\circ}$ 相移。即正频率滞后 $\\pi/2$ ，负频率导前 $\\pi/2$ ，因此希尔伯特变换器又称 $90^{\\circ}$ 移相器。希尔伯特变换器又称 $90^{\\circ}$ 移相器，如下图。两次希尔伯特变换之后，原信号相位翻转了 $180^{\\circ}$ ，四次希尔伯特变换之后又变回本身。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            437,
            850,
            539
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/48eb84eb2a3950458105e9f65ac0d1ed2ce306c33e90989a3d4ac1df6e4bd0ad.jpg",
