    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 44: 如图所示, 理想 $-\\pi/2rad$ 全通相移器的频响特性定义为",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            85,
            702,
            102
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nH (\\omega) = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} - j & \\omega > 0 \\\\ j & \\omega <   0 \\end{array} \\right.\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            406,
            111,
            589,
            145
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1)求该相移器的单位冲激响应 $h(t)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            153,
            468,
            171
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2)对于任意输入 $e(t)$ ，求该相移器的输出 $r(t)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            181,
            559,
            199
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3)当 $e(t)=\\cos\\omega_{0}t$ 时，求该相移器的输出 $r(t)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            210,
            571,
            228
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/91cec6fda037c7ce7082a8ae12637d3b772eafa8c369f4111403161d66c2a184.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
