            354,
            975
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点7：系统可实现的(因果)的约束条件—希尔伯特变换变换对",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            146,
            85,
            806,
            105
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "系统可实现性的实质是具有因果性。本节将要证明，由于因果性的限制，系统函数的实部与虚部或模与辐角之间将具备某种相互制约的特性，这种特性以希尔伯特(Hilbert)变换的形式表现出来。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            117,
            850,
            191
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "对于因果系统，其冲激响应 $h(t)$ 在t<0时等于0，仅在t>0时存在，因此",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            200,
            810,
            218
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nh (t) = h (t) u (t) ①\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            416,
            230,
            579,
            249
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "设 $h(t)$ 的傅里叶变换即系统函数 $H(\\mathrm{j}\\omega)$ 可分解为实部 $R(\\omega)$ 和虚部 $jX(\\omega)$ 之和",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            256,
            800,
            275
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nH (j \\omega) = \\mathcal {F} [ h (t) ] = R (\\omega) + j X (\\omega)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            347,
            284,
            647,
            303
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "对式①运用傅里叶变换的频域卷积定理得到",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            310,
            536,
            326
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\mathcal {F} [ h (t) ] = \\frac {1}{2 \\pi} \\{\\mathcal {F} [ h (t) ] * \\mathcal {F} [ u (t) ] \\}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            351,
            336,
            642,
            372
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "于是有",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            378,
            213,
            395
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r} R (\\omega) + j X (\\omega) = \\frac {1}{2 \\pi} \\bigg \\{[ R (\\omega) + j X (\\omega) ] * \\bigg [ \\pi \\delta (\\omega) + \\frac {1}{j \\omega} \\bigg ] \\bigg \\} \\\\ = \\frac {1}{2 \\pi} \\bigg \\{R (\\omega) * \\pi \\delta (\\omega) + X (\\omega) * \\frac {1}{\\omega} \\bigg \\} + \\frac {j}{2 \\pi} \\bigg \\{X (\\omega) * \\pi \\delta (\\omega) - R (\\omega) * \\frac {1}{\\omega} \\bigg \\} \\\\ = \\left\\{\\frac {R (\\omega)}{2} + \\frac {1}{2 \\pi} \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} \\frac {X (\\lambda)}{\\omega - \\lambda} d \\lambda \\right\\} + j \\left\\{\\frac {X (\\omega)}{2} - \\frac {1}{2 \\pi} \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} \\frac {R (\\lambda)}{\\omega - \\lambda} d \\lambda \\right\\} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            211,
            404,
            784,
            530
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解得",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            538,
            194,
            554
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nR (\\omega) = \\frac {1}{\\pi} \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} \\frac {X (\\lambda)}{\\omega - \\lambda} d \\lambda ②\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            378,
            563,
            618,
            602
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nX (\\omega) = - \\frac {1}{\\pi} \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} \\frac {R (\\lambda)}{\\omega - \\lambda} d \\lambda ③\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            371,
            609,
            623,
            648
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "式②与式③称为希尔伯特变换对。它说明了具有因果性的系统函数 $H(\\omega)$ 的一个重要特性：实部 $R(\\omega)$ 被已知的虚部 $X(\\omega)$ 唯一地确定，反过来也一样。",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            657,
            848,
            703
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "从以上推证过程可以看出，傅氏变换实部与虚部构成希尔伯特变换对的特性，不只限于具有因果性的系统函数，对于任意因果函数，其傅氏变换的这种特性都是成立的。也即，若函数 $f(t)$ 满足",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            713,
            850,
            785
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf (t) = f (t) u (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            426,
            795,
            569,
            814
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "且 $f(t)$ 的傅里叶变换为",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            822,
            349,
            838
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nF (\\omega) = R (\\omega) + \\mathrm{j} X (\\omega)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            400,
            848,
            594,
            866
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "则 $R(\\omega)$ 与 $X(\\omega)$ 之间构成希尔伯特变换对[满足式②与式③的互换关系]。",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            873,
            768,
            892
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
